  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">可破壞的監運器與寶箱</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>允許安全地破壞監運器和寶箱。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/6NJZSxXFPV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-JOIN-3f0f0f?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbobotweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-SUPPORT-3f0f0f?style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fiverr.com%252fs%252f1qZlPl6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fiverr-HIRE ME-3f0f0f?style=for-the-badge&logo=fiverr&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Fiverr\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/PgHqGO4D/images/2448c441028d6db7058142cf8990b6bc1ee5173e.gif\" alt=\"trial-spawner\"></p>\n<h3><strong>監運器</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>監運器</strong>&nbsp;在破壞時掉落其中的&nbsp;<strong>生成蛋</strong>（即使沒有&nbsp;<strong>精靈之觸</ref>）</li>\n<li>使用&nbsp;<strong>精靈之觸</ref>&nbsp;會掉落&nbsp;<strong>監運器</strong>&nbsp;或&nbsp;<strong>寶箱塊</ref> 本身</li>\n<li><strong>蛋保護功能</strong>：防止重複使用相同的生成蛋，並在切換類型時掉落舊的蛋。</li>\n<li><strong>停用機制</strong>：在監運器四側放置蠟燭會使其停用（觸發 10 秒冷卻時間）。</li>\n<li><strong>冷卻保留</strong>：剩餘的冷卻時間會保存到監運器物品中，再次放置時恢復。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>寶箱</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>詛咒寶箱</strong></ref> 作為&nbsp;<strong>「詛咒寶箱</ref>」&nbsp;掉落且放置後保持詛咒狀態</li>\n<li>普通&nbsp;<strong>寶箱</ref>&nbsp;則正常掉落和放置</li>\n</ul>\n<p>適合建築師、地圖製作者以及自動化裝置。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/PgHqGO4D/images/e475b0a035f348323202398c4cbe82b3a6b48e39.gif\" alt=\"ominous vault\"></p>",
